<table>
<tr><th>子集</th><th>构成</th><th>张数</th><th>用途</th></tr>
<tr><td><b>val</b></td><td>每个类前 50 张（deterministic file order）</td><td><span class="num">50,000</span></td><td>评测（lp/zs 都在这上面算）</td></tr>
