<ul><li><code>per_class=50</code>：每类 50 张 val + 50 张 probe-train，固定。</li><li><code>max_files=40</code>：扫前 40 个 parquet 分片足够凑满 1000 类 × 100 张。</li><li>图片解码后经 <code>get_val_transform(224)</code>（CLIP 归一化：MEAN/STD 见 <code>data.py:10-11</code>），<b>全部 stack 到 GPU 显存</b>一次性解码复用给所有 ckpt。</li></ul>
<h3>3.2 Zero-shot — <code>zero_shot()</code> (L127–132) + <code>text_class_embeddings()</code> (L114–124)</h3>
<pre><code><span class="ln">117</span>    for name in IMAGENET_CLASSNAMES:
<span class="ln">118</span>        caps = [t(name) for t in OPENAI_IMAGENET_TEMPLATES]
<span class="ln">122</span>        feats.append(z.mean(0))
<span class="ln">124</span>    return torch.nn.functional.normalize(Z, dim=-1)
<span class="ln">128</span>    In = torch.nn.functional.normalize(I.float(), dim=-1)
<span class="ln">129</span>    sim = In @ Z.T
