<ul><li><b>1000 类 × 80 个 OpenAI prompt 模板</b> → 每类 80 个 caption 的文本嵌入<b>取平均</b> → L2 归一化 → <code>Z ∈ ℝ^{1000×768}</code>。</li><li>图像特征 L2 归一化后与 <code>Z.T</code> 做矩阵乘 → <code>argmax</code> = top-1，<code>topk(5)</code> = top-5。</li><li><b>top-1 定义</b>：<code>(pred == val_labels).float().mean()</code>（L181）；<b>top-5 定义</b>：<code>(top5 == val_labels.unsqueeze(1)).any(1).float().mean()</code>（L182）。</li></ul>

<h3>3.3 Linear-probe — <code>linear_probe()</code> (L135–149) <span class="tag tag-key">主指标</span></h3>
<pre><code><span class="ln">135</span>def linear_probe(Xtr, ytr, Xva, yva, device, epochs=100, lr=3e-3):
<span class="ln">137</span>    """Single Linear(768 -> 1000) + softmax, AdamW, full-batch on GPU, 100 epochs."""
<span class="ln">139</span>    clf = torch.nn.Linear(d, 1000).to(device)
<span class="ln">140</span>    torch.manual_seed(0)
<span class="ln">141</span>    opt = torch.optim.AdamW(clf.parameters(), lr=lr)
<span class="ln">143</span>    for _ in range(epochs):
<span class="ln">145</span>        ce(clf(Xtr), ytr).backward()
<span class="ln">148</span>        pred = clf(Xva).argmax(1)
<span class="ln">149</span>    return (pred == yva).float().mean().item()</code></pre>
<table>
<tr><th>参数</th><th>值</th><th>说明</th></tr>
<tr><td>分类器</td><td><code>Linear(768 → 1000)</code></td><td>单层线性，无隐藏层、无激活</td></tr>
<tr><td>输入特征</td><td><b>raw, 非 L2-normalized</b></td><td>直接用 trunk <code>pooled</code> 输出</td></tr>
<tr><td>优化器</td><td>AdamW, lr=3e-3</td><td>固定，无 weight decay、无 warmup、无 schedule</td></tr>
<tr><td>训练方式</td><td><b>full-batch</b>（49,970 张一次性前向）</td><td>无 mini-batch → 无 batch-size 超参</td></tr>
<tr><td>步数</td><td>100 epochs</td><td>固定</td></tr>
<tr><td>随机种子</td><td><code>torch.manual_seed(0)</code></td><td>分类器权重初始化可复现</td></tr>
<tr><td>评测</td><td><code>clf(Xva).argmax(1) == yva</code></td><td>top-1 accuracy on val 50,000</td></tr>
</table>
<h3>3.4 Checkpoint 加载与特征抽取</h3>
<p><code>load_vision()</code> (L85–98) 从 <code>state['vision']</code> 重建视觉塔，<code>encode_images()</code> (L104–111) 以 bs=128 分批前向（bf16 → <code>.float()</code>）。</p>
<pre><code><span class="ln">104</span>@torch.no_grad()
<span class="ln">108</span>        b = imgs[i:i + bs].to(device).float().to(torch.bfloat16)
<span class="ln">110</span>            outs.append(vision(b))</code></pre>
<p><b>关键</b>：<code>vision(b)</code> 返回 <b>pooled</b> 特征（<code>ReadoutHead</code>：<code>mean(dim=1) → LayerNorm → Linear(width→768)</code>，见 <code>models.py:156–164</code>）→ lp 输入是 <b>768 维 pooled embedding</b>，<b>不是</b>逐 patch 特征。</p>
